#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# File:         audio2itemlist.args
#
# Description:  Tag name translations for copying ID3, Vorbis and Matroska
#               audio tags to QuickTime ItemList (M4A/MP4)
#
# Usage:        exiftool -tagsFromFile SRCFILE -@ audio2itemlist.args DSTFILE
#
# Requires:     ExifTool version 11.39 or later
#
# Revisions:    2026-10-30 - Original code from github #497
#
# References:   https://github.com/exiftool/exiftool/issues/497
#
# Notes:     1) The first argument copies the tags whose names are the same
#               in both formats (Title, Artist, Album, Genre, Composer,
#               Comment...), and the others copy the year, track number,
#               disc number and album artist, which have different names, to
#               the atoms that music players read (\xa9day, trkn, disk, aART).
#
#            2) When the source has several of the tags translated to the
#               same destination tag, the last one listed wins.  A number
#               and its total are joined when the source has both.
#
#            3) These arguments will not delete existing tags which are
#               missing from the source.
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-all

# year or date
-ItemList:ContentCreateDate#<ID3:Year#
-ItemList:ContentCreateDate#<ID3:RecordingTime#
-ItemList:ContentCreateDate#<Vorbis:Date#
-ItemList:ContentCreateDate#<Matroska:DateReleased#

# track number (and total)
-ItemList:TrackNumber<ID3:Track
-ItemList:TrackNumber<Vorbis:TrackNumber
-ItemList:TrackNumber<$Vorbis:TrackNumber of $Vorbis:Tracktotal
-ItemList:TrackNumber<$Vorbis:TrackNumber of $Vorbis:Totaltracks
-ItemList:TrackNumber<Matroska:PartNumber
-ItemList:TrackNumber<$Matroska:PartNumber of $Matroska:TotalParts

# disc number (and total)
-ItemList:DiskNumber<ID3:PartOfSet
-ItemList:DiskNumber<Vorbis:Discnumber
-ItemList:DiskNumber<$Vorbis:Discnumber of $Vorbis:Disctotal
-ItemList:DiskNumber<$Vorbis:Discnumber of $Vorbis:Totaldiscs

# album artist
-ItemList:AlbumArtist<ID3:Band
-ItemList:AlbumArtist<Vorbis:Albumartist

# end